    {
      "text": "Jynx walks rhythmically, swaying and shaking its hips as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without giving any thought to what they are doing.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jynx walks rhythmically, swaying and shaking its hips as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without giving any thought to what they are doing.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sways its hips to a rhythm all its own. The precise movements of Jynx living in Alola are truly wonderful.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its strange cries sound like human language. There are some musicians who compose songs for Jynx to sing.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears to move to a rhythm of its own, as if it were dancing. It wiggles its hips as it walks.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears to move to a rhythm of its own, as if it were dancing. It wiggles its hips as it walks.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "In certain parts of Galar, Jynx was once feared and worshiped as the Queen of Ice.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Jynx of Galar often have beautiful and delicate voices. Some of these Pokémon have even gathered a fan base.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
